<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>English Club Online for Kids</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@600&family=Poppins&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>JOIN OUR <span>ENGLISH CLUB</span> ONLINE!</h1>
    <p>Fun • Interactive • Christian Values</p>
    <p>📚 For Kids Aged 7-16 — via Zoom</p>
    <a href="#form" class="cta-button">Join for Free Now</a>
  </section>
  <section class="about">
    <h2>About the English Club</h2>
    <p>
      Our English Club helps children become confident in speaking, thinking critically, and loving the English language through fun weekly Zoom sessions. 
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="benefits">
    <h2>What Your Child Will Get</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>✅ Speak English with Confidence</li>
      <li>✅ Fun & Relevant Materials</li>
      <li>✅ Monthly Certificate</li>
      <li>✅ Friendly, Experienced Teachers</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="schedule">
    <h2>Class Schedule</h2>
    <p>🧒 Ages 7–9: Saturday at 10:00 WIB</p>
    <p>🧑 Ages 10–12: Saturday at 13:00 WIB</p>
    <p>👦 Ages 13–16: Sunday at 15:00 WIB</p>
  </section>
  <section class="form-section" id="form">
    <h2>Register Now – 1st Month is FREE!</h2>
    <form>
      <input type="text" placeholder="Parent's Name" required />
      <input type="email" placeholder="Email Address" required />
      <input type="text" placeholder="Child's Name" required />
      <input type="number" placeholder="Child's Age" required />
      <button type="submit">Submit</button>
    </form>
  </section>
  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 English Club Online | Contact: WhatsApp / IG / Email</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>

